  "design_notes": [
    "\"Crewed only\": the options list C4 (launch escape system required, 5.1) and C6. Table 5.1 does not say whether C6 Lunar Loop is crewed; it is included so the options exist if it is.",
    "Escape tower: \"jettisoned after ~2.5 min\" is stored as jettison_time_s 150 and carried_all_flight false.",
    "Ejection seats: the Mass cell says only \"0.4 t\". carried_all_flight is required by the schema and is set to true as a choice of this file (nothing says the seats are jettisoned); confirm with the design owner.",
    "abort_envelope_max maps the Abort envelope column: \"Pad → upper atmosphere\" upper_atmosphere, \"Pad → orbit\" orbit, \"Pad & low altitude only\" low_altitude.",
    "The table has no cost, reliability or maturity: \"cheap\" (ejection seats) and \"proven\" (tower) are texts only. Stats are tagged game_value: the design states no provenance for them.",
    "Flags: crew_safety_score_capped (ejection seats; no cap value is given) and enables_propulsive_landing_upgrades (pusher engines; 7.19 says propulsive capsule landing \"needs pusher escape engines\").",
    "F30 (Soyuz MS-10) is the \"Did you know?\" line under the table and is kept at category level: the line names no option."
  ],
